### Phase 2 mock registry examples (IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client). Run the app first.

### Active GSTIN -> 200, active=true
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/32TTNXB7384T1ZW

### Cancelled -> 200, active=false
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/37IHKXV5167L1ZS

### Suspended -> 200, active=false
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/23QYBXS1811Q1ZD

### Lowercase -> 200 (normalized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/32ttnxb7384t1zw

### Bad checksum (tampered) -> 400 INVALID_CHECKSUM
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/08YKZXS8189L1Z0

### Bad format -> 400 INVALID_FORMAT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/ABC123

### Valid checksum, not in registry -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/27AAAXA0000A1ZR

### Udyam found -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/udyam/UDYAM-KL-00-3078801

### Udyam with OCR space -> 200 (normalized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/udyam/UDYAM-MH-%2000-6131836

### Udyam not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mock/udyam/UDYAM-MH-00-0000000

### Verify with OCR correction -> corrected to 19EOGXH4115Y1ZL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

< ./verify-ocr-correction.json

### Verify tampered -> no correction, checksumValid=false
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mock/gstin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

< ./verify-tampered.json
